{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22031","headline":"有木诗八首 二 · 白居易","name":"有木诗八首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有木名樱桃，得地早滋茂。\n叶密独承日，花繁偏受露。\n迎风闇摇动，引鸟潜来去。\n鸟啄子难成，风来枝莫住。\n低輭易攀玩，佳人屡回顾。\n色求桃李饶，心向松筠妬。\n好是映墙花，本非当轩树。\n所以姓萧人，曾爲伐樱赋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}